{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nGenerate an action plan to solve the task. Set initial_data to the exact input string from the task. Available actions: Split (split string by character into array), StrPos (get character at given index from each string in array), Merge (join array of strings with character). Example: for \"get first letter of each word in 'Hi Bob'\", set initial_data=\"Hi Bob\", then Split(\" \"), StrPos(0), Merge(\"\").\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Concatenate the second letter of every word in \"Jack Ryan\" together"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"initial_data":{"type":"string"},"plan":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"integer"},"type":{"type":"string","enum":["split","strpos","merge"]},"parameter":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}]}},"required":["id","type","parameter"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["initial_data","plan"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}